WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 18 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.330
Passie! Look at that weird thing in her hand! That's definitely some kind of black magic tool meant to kill us.

2
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:17.330
Relax, Rosie. I've already had it checked. Our dear sister doesn't have that kind of power.

3
00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:23.330
Oh yeah? I wonder who was crawling out of my place screaming that day.

4
00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.330
General Patton!

5
00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:34.340
Oh my god, it's General Patton? The guy hates the portrait so much, he personally hacked three painters to pieces!

6
00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:39.340
General Patton is obsessed with his image. Nothing pisses him off more than an artist making him look ugly.

7
00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:43.340
Princess Sylvia claims she's better than the Empire's most famous painters.

8
00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.340
She says that little tool in her hand can capture a person's most perfect moment. Would you like to try it?

9
00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:54.870
You want to draw a portrait of me? Just so you know, I don't have much patience.

10
00:00:54.870 --> 00:01:00.870
I don't need to draw anything. Just stand right there. Give me 30 seconds and I'll be done.

11
00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.870
30 seconds? Do you even know what happens if you cross the general?

12
00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:08.870
Let her talk, Rosie. It's much more fun to watch her dig her own grave.

13
00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:14.500
Are you sure you want to go through with this, Sylvia?

14
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:22.500
If you and your little pets get on your knees and beg for mercy right now, I might consider putting in a good word for you with the general.
